RUN: %PLC -c --fpic %S/reference_to_return_lib.st -o %t.lib.o
RUN: %COMPILE -i %S/reference_to_return_lib.st %S/reference_to_return_main.st %t.lib.o && %RUN | %CHECK %s

reference_to_return_lib.st is compiled to its own object. The program includes
it and links that object. The symbols generated for the REFERENCE TO return
value must be defined only in the object built from reference_to_return_lib.st.

